{"summary":"Golf on the go!","description":"It's not real golf, but it's OK!\n\nOK Golf is the essence of golf, refined to a tee. Play a quick round anywhere, anytime on stylish dioramas inspired by classic golfing destinations. Easy to play, hard to put down, perfect for all ages and handicaps! \n\nSIMPLE\nJust aim, drag and release to shoot the ball. No clubs, just you and the ball.\n\nBEAUTIFUL\nInspired by beautiful and iconic locations, each course is a handcrafted miniature diorama.\n\nRELAXING\nEnjoy a moment of zen while you play a round of golf immersed in the calming sounds of nature.\n\nREPLAYABLE\nUnlock new courses and secret areas and challenge yourself with different game modes.\n\nBUY ONCE\nPay once, get all future courses for free!\n\n\"You're going to enjoy the time you spend with it.\" - Pocket Gamer\n\nVisit us at: www.okidokico.com\nFollow us on Twitter @playdigious\nLike us on Facebook /playdigious\nIf you experience any problem with OK Golf, please contact our customer support team at playdigious@gmail.com. Don't forget to specify which device and operating system you are using.\nSupported languages: English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese, Russian, Japanese.","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XGZ3w77KfqA?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/tjlSqo-dwGuf4BCjbkzQfV-SctNEDTucnYnaQPgkJE8nvmCo57P600XfxmuyrAuNuTVZ1RDnGLusih5_I880MA","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8Sb4gHLZ-GGtcWj0c1KhB6C0H_0jBQfgDWhr13mMsxsc1ne89MQtvRx7o7nn0cAiu7-A_BnkK5vdWy0nWBSrrw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ik4fDQs1x4VDxhrcEf-9g_lAI4fhoF5hpO-voYzlK1oFqP8x6VraXFx73ZYdrKQab6FvBUPXd73NVxhi9BuO0A","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/u8O2B6Wun6mi8QtmgKvN_Ih0R9C5eE2D-bQpmc51CcqYAL5O51AuqqE9JN30gc_n-XTN0v1Czjp4MWGQDyh-4w","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/3YetHaeNYeDJ1_7N1U5ic7NG